  "releaseNotes": "Fix LegacyTransport (raw XOR/TCP protocol) connection reuse: the device-side socket can be closed by the remote device after a period of inactivity, which previously caused failures when the cached persistent connection was reused. LegacyTransport now tracks time since last activity and automatically closes and reconnects the persistent connection if it has been idle for more than 10 seconds, while still keeping the connection open and reused for active/back-to-back commands.",
